2026-06-26 14:21:08,285 | INFO | HTTP Request: POST http://127.0.0.1:11434/api/chat "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
2026-06-26 14:21:08,285 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: To address the client's requirements for an intelligent assistance tool, our company, Faber IA, can leverage its Atelier platform and AI capabilities. We will utilize a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) approach, which grounds answers in validated material and limits unsupported generation. This core approach ensures explainability and reliability by citing source passages and providing a retrieval trace.

Our innovation strategy involves iterative methodologies, including corpus curation with the firm's experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop to measure answer quality. We will focus on delivering contextualized answers grounded in cited sources, which aligns with the client's requirements.

To ensure reliability and traceability of outputs, we will implement features such as source citations, retrieved passages, and a complete audit trail for every interaction. Our platform can be configured to refrain from producing ungrounded numeric claims and flag missing sources instead of guessing, addressing the client's need for reliable figures.

